sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Instructor as Instructeur / Auteur
    participant GW as API Gateway (8080)
    participant Course as Course Service (8082)
    participant Auth as Auth Service (8081)
    participant CodeExec as Code Execution Service (8083)
    participant Rabbit as RabbitMQ (Exchange: skillquest.events)

    Note over Instructor,Auth: 1. Création de Cours (Validation Synchrone)
    Instructor->>GW: POST /api/courses (Titre, Modules, InstructorId)
    GW->>Course: Relaye la requête
    Course->>Auth: [REST Synchrone] GET /api/auth/users/:id/summary
    Auth-->>Course: 200 OK (Nom, Statut actif, ROLE_INSTRUCTOR)
    Course->>Course: Enregistrement MongoDB & Publication
    Course-->>GW: 201 Created (courseId)

    Note over CodeExec,Course: 2. Validation Automatique d'Avancement (Consommation Asynchrone)
    CodeExec->>Rabbit: [Événement Émis] CodeSolutionPassedEvent (code.solution.passed)
    Rabbit->>Course: [Événement Consommé] CodeSolutionPassedEvent
    Course->>Course: markLessonCompleted(exerciseId) & recalcule % avancement
    alt Si cours achevé à 100%
        Course->>Rabbit: [Événement Publié] CourseCompletedEvent (course.completion.completed)
    end
